#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""omatop: who is eating this laptop, grouped by app and by site.

Subcommands
  watch [--interval S] [--light]   stream one JSON snapshot per line
  close-site --targets ID,ID       close Chromium tabs/windows via DevTools
  activate-site --target ID        bring that tab or web-app window to front
  focus-app --pids PID,PID         focus the Hyprland window of any of these pids
  kill --pids PID,PID [--force]    SIGTERM (or SIGKILL) a process group

Standard library only. The Chromium DevTools client below speaks the
websocket protocol by hand so the plugin has no dependencies to install.
"""
